      "side": 1,
      "message": "Greg, these cpu isolation patches are not being submitted upstream because we already know they wouldn\u0027t be accepted in current form. QC needs this feature and it\u0027s a little too invasive for vendor hooks, so right now the goal is to review the full set and then decide how best to proceed. The -2 is fine since these (and the rest of the isolation patches that are coming soon) need discussion with us and with the ARM scheduler team. There is a side discussion going on about how to upstream this functionality, but it is useful to see the patches for that discussion.",
